#: data/maps/SlateportCity_PokemonCenter_1F/scripts.inc:27
msgctxt "SlateportCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_RaiseDifferentTypesOfPokemon"
msgid ""
"Want a tip for battling?\p"
"I'd say it's raising different kinds\n"
"of POKéMON in a balanced manner.\p"
"It's no good to make just one\n"
"POKéMON strong.\p"
"If it has a type disadvantage,\n"
"it might not stand a chance.$"
msgstr ""
"想知道对战的诀窍吗？\p"
"我觉得是要均衡地培养各种不同的\n"
"宝可梦。\p"
"只把一只宝可梦培养得很强是不行的。\p"
"要是属性上处于劣势，\n"
"可能就毫无胜算了。$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_PokemonCenter_1F/scripts.inc:36
msgctxt "SlateportCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_TradedMonWithFriend"
msgid ""
"I trade POKéMON with my friends.\p"
"If a traded POKéMON is holding an\n"
"item, it makes me twice as happy!$"
msgstr ""
"我会和朋友们交换宝可梦。\p"
"如果交换来的宝可梦还携带着道具，\n"
"我就会加倍开心！$"
